    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>2. Eligibility Requirements for Returns</h2>
      
      <h3>2.1 Eligible Return Conditions</h3>
      <p>To qualify for a refund under our 30-day guarantee, returned items must satisfy all following requirements:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Original Condition:</strong> The bike must be <strong>unused, unridden, and in pristine brand-new condition</strong> with zero odometer miles, zero dirt or tire wear, and zero cosmetic scratches.</li>
        <li><strong>Original Packaging:</strong> Returned in the original heavy-duty shipping box/crate with all factory molded foam inserts, protective wrap, and zip-ties.</li>
        <li><strong>Complete Accessories:</strong> All included items—fast charger, lithium battery, 2 ignition keys, user manual, tool kit, and hardware—must be returned intact.</li>
        <li><strong>Proof of Purchase:</strong> Valid Bike Bee order number and email address associated with the transaction.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>2.2 Non-Returnable Items</h3>
      <p>The following cannot be accepted for return or refund:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Any bike that has been ridden outdoors, assembled, or operated.</li>
        <li>Products displaying signs of crashes, off-road usage, mud, water damage, or road debris.</li>
        <li>Items modified with aftermarket electronic speed controllers, aftermarket batteries, or modified wiring.</li>
        <li>Purchases returned without prior written Return Authorization (RA) from Bike Bee.</li>
        <li>Gift cards, downloadable products, or promotional free gifts.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

