            <p>Email our California support team at <a href="mailto:contact@bikebee.shop">contact@bikebee.shop</a> within 30 days of delivery. State your order number, reason for return, and include high-resolution photos of the bike and packaging.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">2</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Receive Return Authorization (RA)</h4>
            <p>Our team reviews your submission within 24 to 48 hours. Upon approval, we issue an official Return Authorization (RA) number, authorized return shipping address, and freight instructions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">3</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Securely Repack the Bike</h4>
            <p>Pack the bike securely within its original protective shipping carton. Affix the provided return shipping label and clearly write your RA number on the outside of the packaging.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">4</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Carrier Pickup / Drop-off</h4>
            <p>Coordinate freight carrier pickup (FedEx Freight or UPS) as instructed in your RA email. Retain your carrier pickup receipt and tracking number.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="step-card">
          <div class="step-number">5</div>
          <div class="step-body">
            <h4>Inspection & Refund Disbursement</h4>
            <p>Upon arrival at our warehouse, our technicians inspect the product within <strong>3 to 5 business days</strong>. Once verified, your refund is initiated immediately.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
