    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>4. Return Shipping Costs</h2>
      
      <h3>4.1 Defective, Damaged, or Incorrect Shipments</h3>
      <p>If you receive a defective item, transit damage, or the incorrect color/model, <strong>Bike Bee covers 100% of return shipping and replacement freight costs</strong>. We will arrange prepaid freight pickup directly from your address.</p>

      <h3>4.2 Customer Discretion / Buyer's Remorse Returns</h3>
      <p>If you choose to return an eligible, unused bike due to change of mind or personal preference:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The customer is responsible for actual return freight shipping expenses. Due to the weight and lithium battery transport classifications of electric dirt bikes, freight shipping generally ranges between <strong>$150 and $300 USD</strong> depending on geographical location.</li>
        <li>We can provide a discounted carrier bill of lading deducted directly from your refund amount upon request.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>5. Refund Timelines & Method</h2>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Inspection Period:</strong> 3 to 5 business days from warehouse receipt.</li>
        <li><strong>Refund Processing:</strong> Approved refunds are credited to your <strong>original method of payment</strong> (Credit Card, Debit Card, PayPal, or Shop Pay) within <strong>5 to 10 business days</strong> depending on your banking institution.</li>
        <li><strong>Notification:</strong> You will receive an automated email confirmation the moment your refund is credited.</li>
        <li><strong>Late / Missing Refunds:</strong> If 10 business days have elapsed since refund notification, verify with your credit card company or banking institution, then notify us at <a href="mailto:contact@bikebee.shop">contact@bikebee.shop</a>.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>6. Exchanges</h2>
      <p>Due to freight logistics and inventory reservations, we do not operate a direct swap exchange program. If you wish to switch models or color variants, initiate a return for your original unused purchase and place a new order online for your desired model. This ensures fastest delivery.</p>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>7. 100-Day Limited Warranty Coverage</h2>
      <p>In addition to our 30-day money-back guarantee, all new Bike Bee electric dirt bikes include our comprehensive <strong>100-Day Limited Warranty</strong>:</p>
      
      <h3>7.1 What Is Covered</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Electric drive motor defects and internal mechanical failure.</li>
        <li>Lithium-ion battery pack defects (failure to charge, excessive premature cell degradation, BMS failure).</li>
        <li>Motor controller and digital throttle malfunctions.</li>
        <li>Main aluminum alloy frame manufacturing structural welds and defects.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>7.2 What Is Not Covered</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Normal wear items (tires, inner tubes, brake pads, rotors, drive chains, sprockets, grips).</li>
        <li>Damage resulting from collisions, jumps, stunt riding, racing, or off-road crashes.</li>
        <li>Water damage caused by submersion or high-pressure pressure washers.</li>
        <li>Modifications, firmware tampering, or unauthorized aftermarket electrical accessories.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

    <section class="content-section">
      <h2>8. Damaged or Defective Deliveries</h2>
      <p>If your package arrives with visible carton puncture, crushed corners, or freight damage:</p>
      <ol>
        <li><strong>Note the damage on the carrier's Delivery Receipt / Bill of Lading</strong> before signing.</li>
        <li><strong>Do NOT assemble or ride the bike.</strong></li>
        <li>Take multiple clear photos of the carton exterior, shipping label, and damaged parts.</li>
        <li>Email <a href="mailto:contact@bikebee.shop">contact@bikebee.shop</a> within <strong>48 hours of delivery</strong>. We will expedite immediate replacement parts or arrange full bike replacement under transit insurance.</li>
      </ol>
    </section>

